-# What depositors have asked staff to do. A log, not a queue with state: staff
-# read it, act on the object's own surface, and coordinate with each other and
-# with the depositor off-site.
-#
-# One partial for all three kinds, unlike the activity tab's per-kind dispatch.
-# A request always has the same shape — who asked, about what, what they said,
-# where it gets done — and only the chip, the tone and the remedy vary, which
-# the helper already keys off the kind.
.p-3
  %p.text-muted.small.mb-0
    What depositors have asked staff to do for them, because they cannot do it themselves. Each row says what was asked and points at the tool that does it.

%nav.px-3.pb-2{'aria-label' => 'Request kind'}
  = link_to 'All', admin_ledger_path(tab: 'requests', on: @on),
    class: "btn btn-sm me-1 #{@kind.blank? ? 'btn-secondary' : 'btn-outline-secondary'}",
    'aria-current': ('page' if @kind.blank?)
  - AdminNotice::REQUEST_KINDS.each do |kind|
    - current = kind == @kind
    = link_to Admin::LedgerHelper::KINDS.dig(kind, :label), admin_ledger_path(tab: 'requests', kind: kind, on: @on),
      class: "btn btn-sm me-1 #{current ? 'btn-secondary' : 'btn-outline-secondary'}",
      'aria-current': ('page' if current)

= render 'admin/ledger/day_filter'

- if @notices.any?
  .table-responsive
    %table.table.table-borderless.admin-registry-table.ledger-table
      %thead
        %tr
          %th.text-nowrap{scope: 'col'} Asked
          %th{scope: 'col'} For
          %th{scope: 'col'} About
          %th{scope: 'col'} Who asked
      %tbody
        - @notices.each do |notice|
          = render partial: 'admin/ledger/request', locals: { notice: notice }
  %nav.paginate-section{ 'aria-label' => 'Request pages' }
    = paginate @notices, theme: 'blacklight'
- else
  .admin-registry__empty
    %i.fa-solid.fa-clipboard-check.admin-registry__empty-icon{'aria-hidden' => 'true'}
    -# Say which emptiness this is. Narrowed to a day, "nothing asked for yet"
    -# would be a plain lie about the repository.
    - if @on
      %p.mb-1.fw-semibold.text-body= "Nothing asked for on #{@on.strftime('%B %-d, %Y')}"
      %p.mb-0.small.text-muted= link_to 'Show every day', admin_ledger_path(tab: 'requests')
    - else
      %p.mb-1.fw-semibold.text-body Nothing asked for yet
      %p.mb-0.small.text-muted
        Requests to withdraw or move a work, and to restrict a collection or community, appear here.
